From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josip Seketa <josip.seketa@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:36:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 65/72] gdb: do not hide a lost connection while loading the
 vDSO's symbols

The vDSO's symbol loader reported a lost connection as a warning; run went on and asserted.

diff --git a/gdb/symfile-mem.c b/gdb/symfile-mem.c
index 7d86fd88228..f77dabc90e3 100644
--- a/gdb/symfile-mem.c
+++ b/gdb/symfile-mem.c
@@ -207,6 +207,10 @@ add_vsyscall_page (inferior *inf)
 	}
       catch (const gdb_exception_error &ex)
 	{
+	  /* Not if the target has gone: the session cannot continue.  */
+	  if (ex.error == TARGET_CLOSE_ERROR)
+	    throw;
+
 	  exception_print (gdb_stderr, ex);
 	}
     }
